  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When a clan elder grabs for him, Fang Yuan activates jumping grass at once. Green grass that looks like springs grows from his flesh and skin, and he uses that elasticity to jump forward with a sharp rise in speed.",
        "chapters": [
          227
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "movement-in-combat",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_green"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Facing Ou Yang Gong, Fang Yuan keeps canopy Gu up with a spiral bone spear, blood moon Gu, and jumping grass on his feet as he rushes in.",
        "chapters": [
          251
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "movement-in-combat",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_blood_moon_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He activates jumping grass to leap into a Gu Master fight and to jump over zombies beside Ding Hao.",
        "chapters": [
          255
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "movement-in-combat",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ding_hao"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Shang clan city, when Wei Yang charges with broadsword light, Fang Yuan calls jumping grass, grows two spring-like grasses on his feet, stamps, gathers force, and speeds up hard.",
        "chapters": [
          265
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "movement-in-combat",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "char_wei_yang"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He had already opened an arena match by activating jumping grass and bursting forth before greetings finished.",
        "chapters": [
          279
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "movement-in-combat",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Tang Xiong’s bear strength phantom, Fang Yuan wills jumping grass, grows spring-like grass from his soles through his boots, stamps, and leaps far like a frog while he swipes with a moonblade.",
        "chapters": [
          281
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "movement-in-combat",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tang_xiong"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He judges that he only has jumping grass for movement while Wei Yang has rainbow light Gu, so he cannot match that speed.",
        "chapters": [
          266
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "limits-and-plans",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_rainbow_light_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Inventorying his Gu, he places jumping grass Gu on his feet and plans to remove it once the emergency need is gone.",
        "chapters": [
          273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "limits-and-plans",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
